      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِحْشَاةٌ</span></b>  <i>A coarse</i> [<i>garment of the kind called</i>]
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كِسَآء</span>, (As, S, TA,) <i>that abrades the skin:</i> (TA:)
pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحَاشٍ</span>. (As, S.) [But accord. to some, a
garment of this kind is called <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِحْشَأٌ</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِحْشَآءٌ</span>.]

